        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PBB RS814040, 4\" x 4\"  x Square Corners Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Single Action Spring Door Hinge and screws.  This PBB spring hinges are UL Listed for fire door applications. Max door size: 3ft. x 7ft. x 1-3/4 inches. Max door weight: 110 lbs. For doors up to 85 lbs, use 2 spring hinges at center and bottom position with 1 ball bearing hinge at top position. For 85 to 110 lb doors, use 3 spring hinges:\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PBB Full Mortise Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .100</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81071F</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PBB-RS814040-specifications.pdf?v=1704262436\" target=\"new\"><b>PBB RS814040 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually (1 Hinge).</b>\r\n</p>",
